  "description": "What a mount check concludes from the answers of a machine: the first question that fails gives the state and the reason, and what is left out is a healthy answer. The cases marked measured come from docs/research/disk-identity.md, and those of the type ntfs and of hiberfil.sys from docs/research/ntfs-driver.md and test/loopdev, and those of $LogFile from docs/research/ntfs-logfile.md and test/loopdev.",
